// Macro to create hole feature sets and renaming.
// Created 12-20-2023
// By John C.


// #### Creating hole feature set ####
UNDRAW FEATURESET ALL
DELETE BLOCK
ROTATE TRANSFORM ISO1
EDIT OPTIONS CLOSETOL ".0004"
EDIT FEATURECREATE HOLES FIXED OFF
EDIT MODEL ALL SELECT ALL
EDIT FEATURECREATE CREATEHOLES
EDIT MODEL ALL DESELECT ALL
EDIT FEATURESET ; DESELECT ALL
EDIT BLOCK ALL UNLOCK
EDIT BLOCK RESETLIMIT "0"
EDIT BLOCK RESET
BLOCK ACCEPT

 

 

